# fetch-list: one line per archived file -- <class> <filename>
#
# class d2      = fetched from all 5 D2 sources and compared:
#                 useast/uswest/asia/europe (named D2XP gateways) + vegas
#                 (the unnamed Las Vegas IP pool). Byte-identical across all
#                 sources -> canonical files/<filename>; any divergence ->
#                 files/<source>/<filename> for every source.
# class forever = fetched from connect-forever.classic.blizzard.com only
#                 (the Diablo-1 + PowerPC-Mac legacy set). Always placed at
#                 files/forever/<filename>.
#
# The Zig poller only fetches+stages; the pod-0 coordinator compares and
# places. See the poller README for the full placement rule.
